        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_flu.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 953a2632-a2e7-4842-a484-c8953c5bc43b).Image",
        "Description": "The nuclear weapon disposal facility on Hokkaido Island was attacked and captured by Next-Generation Special Forces being led by members of DUCK-HOUND. They&apos;re demanding that the government turn over the remains of Ort Meyer and they say that if their demands are not met within 24 hours, they&apos;ll launch a nuclear weapon. Your mission objective is to stop them by eliminating the members of DUCK-HOUND. There are four of them, including the leader, 74. Strange, I thought there were five...",
